ShoalCave_Text_OfferEbb:
	.string "The water's turning.\n"
	.string "Want to wait for the ebb?$"

ShoalCave_Text_OfferFlood:
	.string "The water's turning.\n"
	.string "Want to wait for the flood?$"

ShoalCave_Text_LowTideOffers:
	.string "The sea draws back.\p"
	.string "SHOAL SALT shows in the mud, and\n"
	.string "the stairs, the lower room and the\l"
	.string "ice room stand open.$"

ShoalCave_Text_HighTideOffers:
	.string "The sea comes in.\p"
	.string "SHOAL SHELLS line the flooded\n"
	.string "shelves of the inner room.$"

ShoalCave_Text_TideWaits:
	.string "The water will wait for you.\n"
	.string "Say the word whenever you like.$"

ShoalCave_Text_Materials:
	.string "Bring four SHOAL SALTS and four\n"
	.string "SHOAL SHELLS from this cave.\p"
	.string "Your first haul earns GLALITITE,\n"
	.string "a Mega Stone for GLALIE. Wear a\l"
	.string "MEGA RING and it's yours.\p"
	.string "The second haul buys my chart of\n"
	.string "the deep ice. After that, salt and\l"
	.string "shells buy furniture for your base.$"

ShoalCave_Text_ConfirmExchange:
	.string "Trade four SHOAL SALTS and four\n"
	.string "SHOAL SHELLS for a {STR_VAR_1}?$"

ShoalCave_Text_RewardBag:
	.string "The materials are perfect!\n"
	.string "Your {STR_VAR_1} is in your BAG.$"

ShoalCave_Text_RewardPC:
	.string "The materials are perfect!\n"
	.string "Your {STR_VAR_1} is in your item PC.$"

ShoalCave_Text_ConfirmCharting:
	.string "Another full haul? Then I'll chart\n"
	.string "the deep ice for you.\p"
	.string "Trade four SHOAL SALTS and four\n"
	.string "SHOAL SHELLS for the chart?$"

ShoalCave_Text_Charted:
	.string "The chart is yours.\p"
	.string "Something rare is stirring in the\n"
	.string "ice room. Go and meet it.$"

ShoalCave_Text_WhichDecoration:
	.string "Salt and shells buy furniture now.\n"
	.string "Which piece would you like?$"

ShoalCave_Text_DecorationTraded:
	.string "A fair trade. It's waiting in your\n"
	.string "decoration PC.$"

ShoalCave_Text_NoRoom:
	.string "Your storage is full.\n"
	.string "Keep your materials until there's room.$"

ShoalCave_Text_Declined:
	.string "No hurry. Bring them back whenever\n"
	.string "you're ready to trade.$"

ShoalCave_Text_WasShoalSaltNowNothing:
	.string "There was some SHOAL SALT here.\n"
	.string "But, there's nothing here now.$"

ShoalCave_Text_WasShoallShellNowNothing:
	.string "There was a SHOAL SHELL here.\n"
	.string "But, there's nothing here now.$"
